  "Four pillars that define our service excellence and travel quality.": "定义我们卓越服务和旅行品质的四大支柱。",
  "Trusted Experience": "值得信赖的经验",
  "Over 8 years of continuous booking experience, verified tour experts, and ATOL/ABTA protected travel networks.": "拥有超过8年的持续预订经验，经过验证的旅游专家，以及获得 ATOL/ABTA 保护的旅游网络。",
  "Direct relationships with hoteliers and global flight networks let us match and beat any competitor pricing.": "与酒店经营者和全球航线网络的直接合作关系，使我们能够提供并击败任何竞争对手的价格。",
