  "What documentation do I need for vehicle rental collections?": "提取租赁车辆需要什么文件？",
  "You must present a valid passport, a driver's license held for a minimum of 1 year, and a valid Credit Card under the main driver's name. Renters must be 21 years or older, and some performance vehicle tiers require an age of 25.": "您必须出示有效的护照、持有至少1年的驾照以及主驾驶人名下的有效信用卡。租车人必须年满21岁，一些高性能车辆级别要求年龄达到25岁。",
  "What is your refund and cancellation policy?": "您的退款和取消政策是什么？",
  "Our tours and holiday packages are fully flexible. You can cancel or make changes to your booking dates up to 14 days prior to departure without incurring any cancellation fees from Premier Tour. Air ticket refunds are subject to individual carrier guidelines.": "我们的旅行团和度假套餐完全灵活。您可以在出发前至少14天取消或更改预订日期，且无需向尊享旅游支付任何取消费用。机票退款受个别航空公司的规定约束。",
  "How do I receive my booking confirmations and travel vouchers?": "我如何收到预订确认信和旅行凭证？",
  "Once you complete your payment on Premier Tour Booking, a confirmation email with your digital itinerary, e-tickets, and rental vouchers will be sent instantly to your registered email address. You can also view, print, and track all your active booking history from your Customer Dashboard.": "一旦您在尊享旅游预订上完成付款，包含您的电子行程单、电子机票和租赁凭证的确认电子邮件将立即发送到您的注册电子邮件地址。您还可以从客户仪表板查看、打印和跟踪所有当前的预订历史记录。",
  "Are flights and accommodations ATOL protected?": "航班和住宿是否受ATOL保护？",
  "Yes! All flight packages, holidays, and hotel stays arranged through Premier Tour Booking are fully protected under our ABTA and ATOL Bonding certifications, ensuring complete financial security for your journey.": "是的！通过尊享旅游预订安排的所有飞行套餐、度假和酒店住宿都受我们ABTA和ATOL绑定认证的全面保护，确保您旅程的完全财务安全。",
  "Do you offer customizable travel dates and layouts?": "你们提供可定制的旅行日期和行程安排吗？",
  "Absolutely. If you require specialized dates, custom hotel room configurations, multi-destination stopovers, or private charter vehicle setups, please submit a Contact Form or contact our 24/7 travel desk at +44 20 8912 3456.": "绝对提供。如果您需要特殊日期、定制酒店房间配置、多目的地中途停留或私人包车安排，请提交查询表单或致电我们的全天候旅游服务台+44 20 8912 3456。",
