  "The Plaza Hotel": "广场酒店",
  "A historic luxury landmark on Fifth Avenue offering refined guest rooms, fine dining, and prestigious white-glove service.": "位于第五大道的历史悠久的豪华地标，提供精致客房、高级餐饮和尊贵的白手套服务。",
