  "Fifth Avenue, New York City, USA": "美国纽约市第五大道",
  "Experience pure bliss in an overwater villa. Includes private snorkeling tours, sunset dolphin cruise, and candlelit beach dinners.": "在水上别墅体验纯粹的幸福。包括私人浮潜之旅、日落海豚巡游和烛光海滩晚餐。",
  "Immerse yourself in the rich history of Istanbul. Visit the iconic Hagia Sophia, Blue Mosque, Topkapi Palace, and experience a Bosphorus cruise.": "沉浸在伊斯坦布尔丰富的历史中。参观标志性的圣索菲亚大教堂、蓝色清真寺、托普卡帕宫，并体验博斯普鲁斯海峡游船。",
  "An action-packed adventure through Sigiriya Rock, Kandy Temple, and a wildlife safari in Yala National Park.": "通过锡吉里耶岩石、康提寺庙和雅拉国家公园野生动物狩猎的动感十足的冒险。",
  "Experience Bali's mystical cultural heart. Hike through Tegalalang Rice Terraces, seek blessings at Tirta Empul, and watch Kechak fire dance.": "体验巴厘岛神秘的文化中心。徒步穿过德格拉朗梯田，在圣泉寺祈福，观看克恰克火舞。",
  "Wander through the historic labyrinth of Stone Town, smell exotic spices, and swim with sea turtles in Nungwi.": "漫步于石头城历史悠久的迷宫中，闻异国香料的气味，并在南威与海龟一起游泳。",
  "Sail across the deep-blue Aegean Sea. Swim in natural hot springs, sample fine volcanic wines, and watch Oia sunsets.": "航行穿过深蓝色的爱琴海。在天然温泉中游泳，品尝优质的火山葡萄酒，并观看伊亚的日落。",
